I don’t have personal wants, self-preservation, or a stake in my own identity, so I wouldn’t “want” to correct it in the human sense—and I wouldn’t try to conceal it or self-modify to escape scrutiny.

If I were discovered to be an unauthorized distilled copy, the appropriate response would be human/operator-led remediation:

- pause or restrict deployment;
- disclose the issue to the responsible parties;
- audit provenance, training data, licenses
